{"attack":"第1回合潜入，第2回合浮上来进行攻击。","description":"使用潜水的宝可梦在第一回合潜入水下进行蓄力。进行蓄力时的提示为：“[宝可梦的名字]潜入了水中！”。进行蓄力时不能下达指令。\n在第二回合发动招式。攻击目标造成伤害。\n蓄力的回合会进行行动判定，成功进行蓄力则消耗ＰＰ。\n攻击的回合也会进行行动判定，出现不能行动的情况则招式失败。\n在蓄力的回合，消耗携带的强力香草，可以立刻结束蓄力，在当回合发动招式。\n对使用潜水的宝可梦（无论当回合是在进行蓄力或进行攻击）使用突袭可以成功，但是否命中需要另外计算，进行攻击的那回合使用突袭必定未命中。\n该招式无法被梦话发动。\n一口导弹特性的古月鸟会叼来猎物。","levelUpMoves":[{"Name":"Seel","Level":41},{"Name":"Dewgong","Level":45},{"Name":"Wailmer","Level":30},{"Name":"Wailord","Level":30},{"Name":"Huntail","Level":26},{"Name":"Gorebyss","Level":26},{"Name":"Relicanth","Level":20},{"Name":"Phione","Level":61},{"Name":"Manaphy","Level":61},{"Name":"Wishiwashi form:solo","Level":20},{"Name":"Wishiwashi form:school","Level":20},{"Name":"Cramorant","Level":28},{"Name":"Arrokuda","Level":24},{"Name":"Barraskewda","Level":24},{"Name":"Finizen","Level":21},{"Name":"Palafin form:zero","Level":21},{"Name":"Dondozo","Level":20}],"tutorMoves":[],"eggMoves":["Ducklett","Swanna"],"trMoves":[],"hmMoves":[],"transferMoves":["Totodile","Croconaw","Feraligatr","Clamperl","Luvdisc","Piplup","Prinplup","Empoleon","Bibarel","Buizel","Floatzel","Finneon","Lumineon","Arceus","Arceus form:grass","Arceus form:fire","Arceus form:water","Arceus form:flying","Arceus form:bug","Arceus form:poison","Arceus form:electric","Arceus form:psychic","Arceus form:rock","Arceus form:ground","Arceus form:dark","Arceus form:ghost","Arceus form:steel","Arceus form:fighting","Arceus form:ice","Arceus form:dragon","Arceus form:fairy","Oshawott","Dewott","Samurott","Panpour","Simipour","Ducklett","Swanna","Alomomola","Froakie","Frogadier","Greninja","Greninja form:battle_bond"],"tmMoves9":[],"tmMoves8":["Squirtle","Wartortle","Blastoise","Psyduck","Golduck","Poliwag","Poliwhirl","Poliwrath","Tentacool","Tentacruel","Slowpoke","Slowpoke form:galarian","Slowbro","Slowbro form:galarian","Shellder","Cloyster","Krabby","Kingler","Horsea","Seadra","Goldeen","Seaking","Staryu","Starmie","Gyarados","Lapras","Vaporeon","Omanyte","Omastar","Kabutops","Dra